{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32646","headline":"宿题金山寺 · 刘沧","name":"宿题金山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一点青山翠色危，云岩不掩与星期。\n海门烟树潮归後，江面山楼月照时。\n独鹤唳空秋露下，高僧入定夜猨知。\n萧疎水木清钟梵，颢气寒光动石池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}